      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LA REINA VEGA (5) looks the one to beat. She debuted at Seymour on heavy ground and was well backed but just found one better, beaten a long neck as favourite. She'll come on from that for the top yard and looks very hard to run down. LADY PUISSANCE (6) made nice improvement second up at Seymour to be beaten a head on heavy going. Can improve again third up and will be hard to hold out. ACTIVATING (1) is a well bred gelding by Tivaci who has jumped out fairly well for the Busuttin & Young stable. Imagine he'll get further but watch the market. CRUSADING KNIGHT (3) is a gelding by Russian Camelot on debut for the Danny O'Brien yard who has claims with Lane booked. UTOPIC FUTURE (4) next best on debut.",
